        "id": 1112784
      },
      "writtenOn": "2014-07-15T22:31:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Enabling TX happens three times almost exactly the same each time.  We should make a function usb_enable_tx that takes the tx_idx, this function should perform the is_reset check from above.  That way some output can be buffered before the endpoint is reset.",
      "revId": "3754b0a427cd866fb247e6fa4a600cf88fb181fb",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
